{"title":"2025 TMTA High School Algebra I Contest Problems/Problem 38","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_I_Contest_Problems/Problem_38&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>How can the given formula <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/b/a/1ba537a989c5832797e558e331a40cd42fdbdfea.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$T=2\\pi\\cdot\\sqrt{\\frac{L}{g}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -21px\" width=\"107\" height=\"56\" /> be rewritten to solve for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/5/9/859ccf4cd60c7bc6b8fa1afc9a42dc811a826d6f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$L$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" />?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/1/4/51463a07eb5f2ecfc214c8cfe05ae7932ad6bd68.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\  L=g\\cdot \\frac{T}{2\\pi} \\qquad \\textbf{(B)}\\  L=2\\pi gT \\qquad \\textbf{(C)}\\  L=g\\cdot \\left(\\frac{T}{2\\pi}\\right)^2 \\qquad \\textbf{(D)}\\  L=\\frac{gT^2}{4\\pi} \\qquad \\textbf{(E)}\\  L=g\\cdot (T-2\\pi)^2 \\qquad$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"828\" height=\"48\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_I_Contest_Problems/Problem_38&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We have:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/6/7/c67919563a6903afa6f3f5e0d3ce7f383601a03d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$T = 2\\pi \\times \\sqrt{\\frac{L}{g}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -21px\" width=\"116\" height=\"56\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/5/e/95e6f0dae6bd7d4983d782ac1e27549db54c0454.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{T}{2\\pi} = \\sqrt{\\frac{L}{g}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -21px\" width=\"84\" height=\"56\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/5/f/25fbcaa2af7e29018b7e1f3a67c2555b1327685d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{L}{g} = (\\frac{T}{2\\pi})^{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"88\" height=\"43\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/e/4/ce49b122bacf6b5237e31586f4aa019e4741e761.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf {(C) } L=g\\cdot \\left(\\frac{T}{2\\pi}\\right)^2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -23px\" width=\"165\" height=\"59\" />\n</p><p>¬anabel.disher\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_I_Contest\" title=\"2025 TMTA High School Algebra I Contest\">2025 TMTA Algebra I</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_I_Contest_Problems\" title=\"2025 TMTA High School Algebra I Contest Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_I_Contest_Answer_Key\" title=\"2025 TMTA High School Algebra I Contest Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_I_Contest_Problems/Problem_37\" title=\"2025 TMTA High School Algebra I Contest Problems/Problem 37\">Problem 37</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_I_Contest_Problems/Problem_39\" title=\"2025 TMTA High School Algebra I Contest Problems/Problem 39\">Problem 3